   "body": "/claim cloud/i1200-opus\n\nPlan (branch `fix/1200-security-hardening`, one PR, one commit per finding, P1 → P5):\n- Re-verify each finding on current `dev-swift` (3dfed07) before touching it; a claim that does not hold is reported on the PR and skipped.\n- P1: `findThread` returns every candidate, the transport skips a candidate without an edit link, the app hides only the located thread (fixture `R333b`).\n- P2: seed `hashCheckSeed()` before the flag check and send with `send(since:)`, new `TopicFlagError.sessionChanged` (captures `P03a`/`P03q`).\n- P3: absent vs unreadable account-sync state; an unreadable one is never overwritten. P4: secure-coded legacy archive decoding with an allowed class list. P5: forum-host `http` hrefs upgraded or refused at the endpoint layer.\n- Each test red first; `swift test` + SwiftLint `--strict` on Linux; draft PR, adversarial review by Fable.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
