   "body": "**Operator decision (2026-11-18), P3 recovery: option (b).** When the account-sync state fails to decode for a reason other than an unknown (later) version, an **explicit switch-off by the user** resets it. The app never resets it silently, and a later-version state stays locked. Because #1202 is already in its final CI, this lands as a small follow-up PR under this issue (`Refs #1200`), reviewed by Fable.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
